# Exp R: Cold 3060Ti (3 layers filler), 3090 picks up slack
run_date: 2026-07-21
branch: experiment/cuda-ipc-events
model: Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-APEX-MTP-I-Quality.gguf
topology: ROCm(7900XTX) + 3060Ti(:50051) + 3090(:50052#0) + 3070(:50052#1) P2P
approach: Interleaved with 3060Ti reduced to 3 cold layers, 3090 gets L15-19 (5 layers)
result: 0.85 tok/s (worse than Exp Q 1.10 tok/s)
bottleneck: 3090 L15-19 block at 340ms (5 layers packed into one split)
3060Ti: 72ms/split (cold filler strategy works)
3070: 193ms/split (3-layer blocks)
ROCm: 13ms/split
